# Pull request workflow

Follow the repository's AGENTS.md and CONTRIBUTING.md.
Use a topic branch and a PR targeting main for every change, including documentation.
Push the topic branch, then create or update its PR; do not push directly to main.
Do not merge, enable auto-merge or rewrite published history without explicit user authorization.
Record the checks actually run and distinguish measured provider tokens from estimates or scripted data.
